igra and ellen when an  enemy archer tries to shoot tigra he  catches the arrow and shoots it back  destroying his bow in the process tita  gives tigra the black bow an heirloom of  his ancestors after his humiliating loss  zion and his army of 2 700 soldiers  clashed with ellen's army of 900  soldiers on the open plains with ellen  antigra leading the charge when our army  defeats zion's first battalion he sends  in his earth dragon which crushes  anything in its path ellen faces the  earth dragon alone while lim and one of  the generals lead cavalry men to  distract the enemy forces using the full  power of her viralt with her long sword  ellen slices the earth dragon in half  while lim leads their pursuers into a  series of traps zion's dismayed and  refuses to send the wyvern into battle  informed the ellen's army is equipped  with 2 000 reinforcements at his rear  zion starts to panic the reinforcements  consisted of a shadow army of only a  hundred men with two thousand horses  zion orders the second battalion to  retreat consequently allowing ellen's  army to slaughter them from behind when  zion attempts to flee on the wyvern  tigra's black bow speaks to him and  absorbs power from ellen's sword  allowing tigru to shoot down the wyvern  and zion ellen's armies celebrate their  victory over felix's army ellen is  summoned to silesia the capital city  leaving lim behind to help tigra in  silesia ellen explains to king victor  that she was hired by tigra to invade  the bruin kingdom to acquire peace in  alsace afterwards ellen starts a quarrel  with almatt's war maid and mila but  they're halted by another war maiden  when tigra and tita return from checking  on the citizens of alsace they're joined  by martias tigra's friend and ally tigre  convinced his other nobles to join his  cause including hughes and his son  gerald ellen tigra and lim discuss their  plans but are interrupted by the arrival  of miele they decide to reconvene in the  village of roderick and mila questions  tigra about his motives as they ride on  horseback along the way they're ambushed  by the seven chains assassins mila uses  her viralt a short spare using  cryokinesis to kill six of these  mercenaries however limbs bitten by a  snake prompting tigra to suck out the  venom tigra and ellen head towards  roderick to get medical attention after  lim recovers from a snake bite ellen  rewards tigra setting up a bath in a  private hot springs bath house with a  displeased miele the four of them then  toured the marketplace in roderick but  mila immediately returns to her snowy  homeland on the border of light merits  ellen orders lim to increase the border  patrol correctly predicting that mila  has mobilized her forces during the  battle ellen's army clashes with mila's  army but their battle ends in a  stalemate mila retrieves to the tatara  fortress a nearly impregnable citadel  and ellen's army settles in for a siege  disguising himself as a bear tigra  scouts for an alternative route to the  fortress before encountering mila she  shares tea with him as she expresses her  misgivings of being a war maiden after  following mila towards the fortress t  group reports back to ellen as ellen and  tigra then lead a raid of 100 men into  the mountains ellen uses her full power  to try to break through the rear gate  but fails when tigret saves ellen from  certain death the two combine their  powers to destroy the rear gate and lead  their men into the breach after  destroying the rear gate of the fortress  ellen jules miele however the jewel is  interrupted by the last member of the  seven chainz assassins only to be killed  by tigra milo realizes that tiga not  only was the bear hunter that she  previously met but also only wants to  protect his friends in gratitude for  tegra saving her life mila declares her  neutrality thus ending the battle on the  western border of the bruin kingdom  roland leader of the nevada knights and  wielder of the legendary sword receives  a royal order to kill tigra later the  alsace army and the light merits army  form an uneasy coalition which is named  the silver meteor storm sophie who was  sent as a diplomatic envoy arrives at  the army camp informing that bruin prime  minister pierre has charged tegra with  treason sophie tells ellen the  whereabouts of the remaining four war  maidens while tigra and hughes struggle  to retain the loyalty of their allies  the novara knights approach enrolled and  rejects all offers of parley during the  battle of orange the silver meteor storm  suffers heavy casualties tigra is  severely injured while saving ellen from  being attacked by roland sophie appears  and uses her viralt a priest staff using  photokinesis to repel oncoming nevada  knights then again to vanish once ellen  and tigra are safely away when martial  martials and his reinforcements arrive  the nevada knights stop their pursuit in  the army cap masha says that he was  unable to meet with king farron though  prime minister told martials that king  faron's health is precarious with  tigrette still unconscious ellen  promises to win the battle and sophie  volunteers to help her after waking up  segre is guided by the black bow and  accompanied by tita to a mysterious  temple belonging to the goddess of night  darkness and death when teachers  possessed tigra shoots tita in a test of  resolve for greater power he controls  this power so that the arrow doesn't  harm tita causing the temple to  disappear the silver meteor storm  diverts the planes into a bog easily  targeting the navarre knight after tegra  arrives at the battlefield despite  reopening his wounds he shoots roland  with his new power roland barely  survives and accepts defeat with half of  the nevada knights dead the battle comes  to an end roland leaves his sword in the  care of tigra ellen receives a letter  from legnica war made in alexandra who  asks for ellen's assistance in dealing  with an invasion meanwhile rola