ere the silver meteor  storm has made a small stronghold on the  first hills kuray splits his army into  seven divisions tigra and mila lead an  ambush at the second hill against the  fifth and sixth divisions however tigra  and mila become surrounded when  attacking the seventh division  tigra and mila are reinforced when  allied knights arrive to aid the silver  meteor storm although the reinforcements  are now a total of five thousand men  another three thousand men led by hughes  also arrived forcing carrays to retreat  and regroup when word reaches curies  that the muzinel fleet left behind to  attack the bruin kingdom's southern  harbour was sunk by felix carreys  decides to withdraw and give his  personal congratulations to tegra via  envoy ellen and lim return to tigra and  mila causing yet another disagreement  between ellen and mila that night tigra  and ellen discussed the battle and  tigrette vows that he won't forget those  who died fighting for him the asteroid  war maiden valentina uses herverold a  grim reaper scythe using umbrokinesis to  witness tigra in his sleep the night  before the battle reagan was attacked by  assassins and was forced to fake her  death without any proof of her bloodline  she can only prove her birthright as  faron's daughter in the holy in  artichome meanwhile felix receives five  dragons and moves to intercept the  silver meteor storm in lutetsia ghanilan  anticipates the final battle between  tigra and then a deer then sets fire in  the capital city during the battle the  silver meteor storm of 20 000 clashes  with the then idea army of 24 000 with  their combined power ellen and mila slay  the three earth dragons but the fire  drake and the double-headed dragon are  armed with magical chains and remain  unscathed after the army is reorganized  tigra leads flanking maneuvers against  the enemy forces while the two war  maidens decide to slay the two remaining  dragons by themselves  after ellen wakes up t grit tells the  girls that their next course of action  is to head to artisan reagan explains  that there are three routes to the holy  grotto and they choose the second route  through the mosha temple taking a hidden  passageway under the temple into the  caverns tigre discovers that then a deer  and his men used another route as a  battle ensues then adir sends his second  in command stead to pursue tigra and  reagan while ellen faces then idea the  cavan begins to collapse and then idea  chooses to retreat however stead  continues to pursue tigre while ellen  and reagan flee tigra is saved by  bertrand at the cost of his life before  stead is crushed by falling rocks  trapped underground tegra rushes to  bertrand who speaks of how fortunate he  was to serve tegra before dying ellen  and reagan pushed back to arteshem where  ellen finds tigra is alive and bertrand  dead in a pit as the final battle with  fennadier approaches the leaders of the  silver meteor storm wonder if tigra will  be able to overcome the death of  bertrand a flashback reveals that tigre  used the black bow to shoot through the  bedrock and create the pit tigrett  recovers his metal when ellen tells him  that she felt pride when she began as a  simple mercenary they then talk about  building a trade route that will connect  their lands the prime minister visits  the army camp informing that farron was  repeatedly poisoned by gun ilon but has  regained his wits during the battle the  fight goes in favor of the silver meteor  storm since dead no longer commands the  thin idea army facing off against the 90  year tigrit draws a single arrow and  throws out his quiver after ellen brings  tegra back to his senses the nadia  charges at tigra who shoots him through  the forehead out of his saddle in nice  the popular celebrates the silver meteor  storm as heroes farron agrees to tigra's  terms for peace and recognizes reagan as  his heir he also honors tigre with the  title knight of the moonlight  traditionally give